Ehi
$cards
DECK 8 SPADES

$initial
DRAW 25 ROTATE 3 U 1
OYOUQ 0 FACE_ALL
OYOUQ 4 FACE_ALL
OYOUQ 4 FACE_ALL

UKAIT 2 FACE_HALF
UKAIT 4 FACE_ALL

WOHEP 3 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
WOHEP 3 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
WOHEP 7 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
WOHEP 4 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
WOHEP 4 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
WOHEP 3 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
WOHEP 9 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST

COLUMN 2 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
COLUMN 0 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
COLUMN 1 FACE_HALF
COLUMN 7 FACE_HALF
COLUMN 8 FACE_HALF
COLUMN 8 FACE_HALF
COLUMN 0 FACE_HALF
COLUMN 6 FACE_HALF

$moves
MOVE_STACK UKAIT {OYOUQ, WOHEP, UKAIT}
OR
    AND
        DESTSRC Rank ascending
        SRCSTACK Size > 8
    AND
        SRCSTACK Rank equal
        SRCSTACK Size <= 9
MOVE_STACK OYOUQ UKAIT
DEST Size > 3
$win
OR
    PILE ALL UKAIT Empty
    AND
        PILE ALL DRAW Empty
        PILE ALL WOHEP Empty
